@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3001
@inquiryId = replace-with-draft-id
@confirmationToken = replace-with-draft-confirmationToken
@adminSession = replace-with-management-session-cookie

### Incomplete gas name: needs_clarification, no products, explicit correction suggestion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"zh","query":"烷泄漏巡检，手持设备"}

### Natural-language search: reviewed gas-imaging products only
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"zh","query":"用于甲烷泄漏巡检的手持气体成像相机"}

### English SF6 search
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"en","query":"SF6 gas imaging at substations"}

### Compare two reviewed products
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"zh","productSlugs":["guide-sensmart-pv400","flir-gf77"]}

### Answer with source sections and stable citation IDs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"zh","question":"PV400 的红外分辨率是多少？","productSlugs":["guide-sensmart-pv400"]}

### Missing information: must return insufficient_evidence
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"zh","question":"PV400 最远检测距离是多少？","productSlugs":["guide-sensmart-pv400"]}

### MUTATING: create a 30-minute anonymous inquiry preview; does not send email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/inquiries/draft
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"zh","query":"甲烷泄漏巡检","question":"请确认镜头配置","requirements":"请由工程师确认目标气体和现场工况。","productSlugs":["guide-sensmart-pv400","flir-gf77"]}

### MUTATING: set confirmed=true only after reviewing the draft and supplying genuine contact details
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/inquiries/{{inquiryId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{"confirmationToken":"{{confirmationToken}}","confirmed":false,"name":"Your name","email":"your-address@example.invalid"}

### Private inquiry inbox: management authentication required; never expose session cookies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/admin/inquiries
Cookie: cooyue_admin_session={{adminSession}}
